= The Wheat Pool

The Wheat Pool is a farmer's cooperative that markets grain produced by it's members.

- @promote_pool
- @farmers_campaign
- @root: Return to main

@promote_pool
title: Agricultural Policy
subtitle: Raises support for Socialism and Cooperatives
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not ccf_ss_in_government : The [+ ccf_ss_name +] is not in government. ?][? if agriculture_minister_party != ccf_ss_name: The [+ ccf_ss_name +] does not have the Agriculture Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; socialism_support += 5; cooperative_support += 5
go-to: agricultural_policy


@farmers_campaign
title: Farmers Campaign
subtitle: Campaign among the farmer populace
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and farmers_policy > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if farmers_policy == 0 : We have not enacted any farmers policies. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; farmers_ccf_ss += 5*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1

We have increased our campaigning among farmers and the farmers populace.

